cifist with a doughnut obsession who's more doofus than desperado. There's a whole lot more to him than his reputation lets on - Vash the Stampede definitely ain't your typical outlaw.\n\n\n\n(Source: Funimation)"],"ja":["TRIGUN",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-53753":"2024-05-07T17:59:14Z","serial-7988":"2020-02-07T17:19:28Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-53753","serial-7988"],"relatedMalIds":[],"rating":8.22,"availableEpisodeCount":26}]}